<title>ESTONIA: EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 1.1 PCT MO/MO IN FEB.</title>
<headline>EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 1.1 PCT MO/MO IN FEB.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's export price index showed a rise of 1.1 percent month-on-month in February, for a year-on-year rise of 6.3 percent, the statistics office said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
